WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.680
You've seen what we can do with one call, here's what happens when you connect all of them.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:13.020
When you connect Fathom, Fireflies, or any recorder to Primal, we pull in your full call

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:20.780
library. Every conversation your team has had. First, we sort them. Won deals over here,

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:28.420
lost deals over there. Then we segment by market, deal size, and sales stage. So you're comparing

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:35.440
apples to apples. From there, Primal reads across your winning calls and pulls out the patterns.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:43.920
The questions your best reps ask. The objections they handle differently. The moments where deals turn.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:52.800
Not theory, your data. Then it builds three things. A training course for your reps

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:59.480
built from your own winning conversations. So every rep can practice what your best rep

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:08.020
already does. A script. Not a generic template. A script grounded in the language and the moves

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:15.720
that actually close deals in your market. And the non-negotiables. The things that have to be

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:23.360
present on every call. Pulled straight out of the calls. You already won. From that point on,

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:31.840
every call your team runs gets rated against them. Same standard in the role play. Same standard in

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:40.800
the coaching. One bar everywhere. The free review showed you one call. This is what it looks like

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:48.940
when your whole team's calls are working for you. Start a free 14 day trial or book a walk through.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:50.540
Links down below.
